  "schema:headline": "An LSTM forecaster for realised volatility on S&P 500 daily prices, released with its performance metrics deliberately withheld.",
  "schema:description": "Forecasts close-to-close realised volatility for ^GSPC from daily prices, 2010-2023. The committed run is released as a reproducible artefact, but its accuracy metrics are not reported: the feature scaler was fitted with fit_transform over the whole series, so every number the run produced is contaminated by lookahead. The card is included here precisely because it is the case the current schema cannot express.\n",
  "fair4ml:mlTask": [
    "Time-series regression"
  ],
  "fair4ml:modelCategory": [
    "Supervised regression",
    "LSTM"
  ],
